---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Ressources — SOSQLIK">
<section class="subhero"><div class="container"><h1>Ressources</h1><p>Modèles, snippets, Qlik Community… pour aller plus loin avec Qlik.</p></div></section>
<section class="page-section"><div class="container resource-grid">
  <article class="mini-card"><b>▣</b><h3>Documentation officielle Qlik</h3><p>La référence technique : Qlik Sense, script, fonctions, Set Analysis, performances et nouveautés.</p><div class="resource-links"><a href="https://help.qlik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Documentation Qlik ↗</a><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/May2026/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/ChartFunctions/SetAnalysis/syntax-for-sets.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Set Analysis ↗</a></div></article>
  <article class="mini-card"><b>▤</b><h3>Articles HIC</h3><p>Les articles pédagogiques de Henric Cronström pour comprendre le pourquoi derrière Qlik.</p><div class="resource-links"><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Natural-Sets/ba-p/1470953" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Natural Sets ↗</a><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/A-Primer-on-Set-Analysis/ba-p/1468344" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A Primer on Set Analysis ↗</a><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Why-is-it-called-Set-Analysis/ba-p/1468208" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Why is it called Set Analysis? ↗</a></div></article>
  <article class="mini-card"><b>◉</b><h3>Outils SOSQLIK</h3><p>Scripts, snippets, modèles et exemples réutilisables produits pour SOSQLIK.</p><div class="resource-links"><a href="/tutoriels">Voir les tutoriels SOSQLIK →</a><span class="resource-coming">Téléchargements et snippets à venir</span></div></article>
  <article class="mini-card"><b>♢</b><h3>Communauté & références</h3><p>Qlik Community et une sélection de ressources externes utiles et vérifiées.</p><div class="resource-links"><a href="https://community.qlik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qlik Community ↗</a></div></article>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>






<!-- SOSQLIK-V4-42-RESOURCE-DIRECTORY -->
<section class="resource-directory">
  <div class="resource-directory-head">
    <h2>Sources et références utilisées</h2>
    <p>Les ressources ci-dessous sont celles que nous utilisons réellement pour construire et vérifier les tutoriels SOSQLIK.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="resource-source-grid">
    <article class="resource-source-card">
      <div class="resource-source-kicker">OFFICIEL</div>
      <h3>Qlik Help</h3>
      <p>La documentation officielle pour la syntaxe, les fonctions, le Set Analysis, Aggr() et les performances.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qlik Help</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/May2026/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/ChartFunctions/SetAnalysis/syntax-for-sets.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Syntaxe du Set Analysis</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/May2026/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/ChartFunctions/SetAnalysis/set-modifiers.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Set modifiers</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/May2026/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/ChartFunctions/aggr.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fonction Aggr()</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/May2026/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/ChartFunctions/NestedAggregations/nested-aggregations.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agrégations imbriquées</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://help.qlik.com/en-US/sense/November2024/Subsystems/Hub/Content/Sense_Hub/Expressions/work-with-expression-editor.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Éditeur d’expressions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resource-source-card">
      <div class="resource-source-kicker">RÉFÉRENCE PÉDAGOGIQUE</div>
      <h3>Henric Cronström — HIC</h3>
      <p>Des articles de fond particulièrement utiles pour comprendre le « pourquoi » derrière Qlik.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Natural-Sets/ba-p/1470953" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Natural Sets</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Why-is-it-called-Set-Analysis/ba-p/1468208" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Why is it called Set Analysis?</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/A-Primer-on-Set-Analysis/ba-p/1468344" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A Primer on Set Analysis</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/New-Set-Analysis-syntax/ba-p/1983110" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">New Set Analysis syntax</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Aggregations-and-Function-Classes/ba-p/1462653" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aggregations and Function Classes</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Count-or-Count-distinct/ba-p/1469730" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Count or Count distinct?</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Average-Which-average/ba-p/1466654" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Average – Which average?</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/The-Above-Function/ba-p/1465357" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Above Function</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/Accumulations/ba-p/1466581" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Accumulations</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="resource-source-card">
      <div class="resource-source-kicker">COMMUNAUTÉ</div>
      <h3>Qlik Community</h3>
      <p>Le forum et le blog Design regroupent des réponses techniques, des exemples et de nombreux articles historiques de référence.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qlik Community</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://community.qlik.com/t5/Design/bg-p/qlik-design-blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qlik Design Blog</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="resource-source-note">
    SOSQLIK est un site indépendant, non affilié à QlikTech. Les ressources externes restent la propriété de leurs auteurs et éditeurs respectifs.
  </p>
</section>
